[type_edits]
file: native/core/crates/mixdog-app-protocol/src/v2/params.rs
struct: LocalProviderSetLocalProviderContextParams
replace the field
    #[cfg_attr(feature = "codegen", ts(type = "number"))]
    pub tokens: i64,
with
    /// `null` is the automatic context size (the old main process accepted it: boundary/validate/capability_settings.rs
    /// refuses only a size below 16384; boundary/validate/capability.rs still requires the field to be present).
    #[cfg_attr(feature = "codegen", ts(type = "number | null"))]
    pub tokens: Option<i64>,
Regenerate schema/*.json and packages/protocol/src/index.ts. No other crate reads the field (grep: none).

[window]
file: native/core/crates/mixdog-app-protocol/src/boundary/window_methods.json
add to "methods" (alphabetical, after "connections/endpoint" and before "host/claim"):
    "dev/computer/run",
and after "host/state/set" and before "modelProxy/run":
    "migrate/profile/adopt",
Reason: neither is reached by a renderer lane through main today (the profile adoption is main's own startup step; dev/computer/run is a
test hook), so a window-scoped connection refuses them like the other host-role methods. WINDOW_SCOPE_VERSION stays 2.
